        "text": "One small study using immersive virtual reality created standard everyday scenes, then showed participants a new scene configured to spatially resemble a previously seen one. Participants were more likely to report the strange feeling that something feels more familiar than it should while viewing these new but structurally similar scenes.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\uddea The Role of Dopamine & Fatigue\n\n",
