      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 Is It a Good Sign or a Bad One?\n\n",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "Contrary to popular belief, d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu is not a memory error. ",
            "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIEBgCIiRkMmJjZWZjOS0wNDQwLTQxYWUtOTM0Mi1hNDFhNjdkYWIzZWQSDIqIzbrwTi0SKD9YgRoMLES3KOPTd3Vj2iFmIjCOnloIDLlHaJGs/pjAcQfoxXZ7Y2iW676r4FFzxDBP9aZKsSYgWEfh4nXoAZmc6vcqE2WQjNPGm+ec8nSgodtDbHqG11oYBA==",
            "title": "The Fascinating Science of D\u00e9j\u00e0 Vu | Psychology Today",
