            "url": "https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/blog/brain-reboot/202312/the-fascinating-science-of-deja-vu"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Contrary to popular belief, d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu is not a memory error.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": " In fact, it may be the opposite \u2014 a sign that your brain is working correctly. ",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
