        "text": "Experiencing d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu is \"probably a good thing for most people. It's a sign that the fact-checking brain regions are working well, preventing you from misremembering events.\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\nThat said, ",
